docs/SPEC.md:25:- Seeded equipment catalog ships in-app: **1887 models across 23 manufacturers** (ticket 20), every name verified against a manufacturer or authorised-dealer listing — sources in `docs/catalog-sources/`. Catalog updates ride app releases as a version bump through the D24 reconciler. Seeded entries have stable catalog IDs that survive updates; user-created entries live in a separate ID space (dedup deferred).
